<title>USA: Genesis to pay $0.50 qtly distribution.</title>
<headline>Genesis to pay $0.50 qtly distribution.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Genesis Energy LP said Monday it will pay a regular quarterly distribution of $0.50 per common unit on August 15, to unitholders of record July 31.</p>
<p>The company paid an initial distribution of $0.66 per common unit May 15, covering the period from December 3 to May 15.</p>
</text>
